    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/816c04984e31fd0dea44a365fc24d892.avif?t=1642437901\" /></div><br><br>Lost in Labs is a 2D platformer, stealth and puzzle game. But with a twist, the player will have the ability to possess and control the movement of NPCs, using this to gather information, to open a door from the other side, or just move this person out of the way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/c82231abb811a9d6c94b4743b646f3fe.avif?t=1642437901\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore</h2>Use Lucian's abilities to explore the enviroment!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/ab1a3b9a4a9ff0939c3dcfe8b96950b1.poster.avif?t=1642437901\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/ab1a3b9a4a9ff0939c3dcfe8b96950b1.webm?t=1642437901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/ab1a3b9a4a9ff0939c3dcfe8b96950b1.mp4?t=1642437901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hide</h2>Lucian must use the enviroment in his advantage in order to succeed, hiding so he won't get caught by the guards. But... what are THEY hiding?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/170e01fc191b2f6681741e94021f964b.poster.avif?t=1642437901\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/170e01fc191b2f6681741e94021f964b.webm?t=1642437901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/170e01fc191b2f6681741e94021f964b.mp4?t=1642437901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Distract</h2>Don't let they stand in your way. Distract others so they don't see you sneaking around.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/999a9f66a1aa45b6b49addcc25cb01d0.poster.avif?t=1642437901\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/999a9f66a1aa45b6b49addcc25cb01d0.webm?t=1642437901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/999a9f66a1aa45b6b49addcc25cb01d0.mp4?t=1642437901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Control</h2>&quot;I have to press that button, but it is too far away!&quot;<br><br>&quot;That guard is in my way...&quot;<br>&quot;I am hungry.&quot;<br><br>In Lost in Labs, two of those can be solved using the possession dynamic.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/287434654a58be6e4d6f9fe1d73e8682.poster.avif?t=1642437901\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/287434654a58be6e4d6f9fe1d73e8682.webm?t=1642437901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/287434654a58be6e4d6f9fe1d73e8682.mp4?t=1642437901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover</h2><br>There is something wrong around here. For Lucian to succeed and rescue his best friend, he'll need to understand the world around him.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/85085ba744ab597c28c4ee14197e3bfa.poster.avif?t=1642437901\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/85085ba744ab597c28c4ee14197e3bfa.webm?t=1642437901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/85085ba744ab597c28c4ee14197e3bfa.mp4?t=1642437901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/98c6e0015b5f7145fd5cbabbee2bb983.avif?t=1642437901\" /></div><br><br>. Be stealthy! You are not supposed to be here<br>. Jump through platforming levels<br>. Possess other NPCs, make them do what you need<br>. Use objects from the level to hide from the guards<br>. Distract the guards, unlock doors and find other hiding spots<br>. Unravel puzzles to carry on with the adventure<br>. Be part of an astonishing and mysterious storyline<br>. Detailed visual art, animations and lighting  <br>. Meet interesting and funny characters<br>. Listen to great original soundtracks and SFXs<br>. Non-stressful gameplay<br>. Mysteries, mysteries, mysteries!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/6b2278af026156778ad3b6508f77929f.avif?t=1642437901\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584970/extras/9ddd3af45a2d27bbddfabdfadd9c88c0.avif?t=1642437901\" /></div>",
